WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.000 --> 01:55.720
=Episode 15=

22
01:58.408 --> 01:59.048
Haoyu,

23
01:59.367 --> 02:00.408
I'm heading to work.

24
02:22.145 --> 02:23.032
(Lu Hui)

25
02:27.157 --> 02:28.422
(Lucky Beauty Yu)

26
02:28.422 --> 02:29.790
(Lu Hui)

27
02:31.167 --> 02:31.927
Wait,

28
02:34.207 --> 02:35.088
before the divorce,

29
02:36.727 --> 02:38.008
Dad was already dating Yu Meng.

30
02:43.368 --> 02:43.887
Dr. Kang.

31
02:43.927 --> 02:44.968
The lab budget approval

32
02:45.088 --> 02:45.808
has been stalled.

33
02:46.128 --> 02:46.968
I urged for times,

34
02:47.288 --> 02:47.808
and was told

35
02:47.848 --> 02:48.727
it's because of you.

36
02:49.408 --> 02:50.088
You promised me

37
02:50.447 --> 02:51.647
your internal power struggles

38
02:51.688 --> 02:52.647
wouldn't affect my lab.

39
02:52.927 --> 02:53.968
What is this about?

40
02:54.927 --> 02:55.568
I haven't gotten

41
02:55.607 --> 02:56.688
any approval documents.

42
02:57.487 --> 02:58.207
Could there be

43
02:58.207 --> 02:59.167
a misunderstanding?

44
02:59.248 --> 03:00.128
Don't worry.

45
03:00.368 --> 03:01.327
I'll check with Finance.

46
03:12.727 --> 03:13.927
Before the funds arrive,

47
03:14.368 --> 03:14.927
the lab

48
03:15.288 --> 03:16.688
will halt all the development.

49
03:18.968 --> 03:19.767
I'll get to it now.

50
03:22.248 --> 03:22.968
Come in.

51
03:25.047 --> 03:25.607
Why hold up

52
03:25.688 --> 03:26.927
the lab budget approval?

53
03:31.927 --> 03:32.767
It's you?

54
03:35.008 --> 03:36.487
A wise bird chooses its perch.

55
03:37.368 --> 03:38.767
You should understand that, Ms. Yu.

56
03:42.408 --> 03:43.848
Give me the lab budget approval.

57
03:44.167 --> 03:45.248
I'm signing it right now.

58
03:46.968 --> 03:48.528
Ms. Yu, you might not know

59
03:49.128 --> 03:49.887
that Finance

60
03:49.887 --> 03:50.927
has procedures.

61
03:51.047 --> 03:51.887
One at a time.

62
03:52.327 --> 03:53.607
First come, first served,

63
03:53.688 --> 03:54.128
right?

64
03:54.927 --> 03:56.088
You need to approve

65
03:56.128 --> 03:57.808
Jinghua's production increase first

66
03:58.288 --> 03:59.447
before we process

67
03:59.447 --> 04:00.167
the lab budget.

68
04:02.008 --> 04:02.727
Fine.

69
04:03.248 --> 04:04.727
Lecturing me on procedures, are you?

70
04:05.688 --> 04:07.128
Either give me the approval,

71
04:07.487 --> 04:08.128
or

72
04:09.415 --> 04:09.848
(Resignation Form)

73
04:09.848 --> 04:11.167
sign this and get lost now.

74
04:11.808 --> 04:12.248
Mr. Di,

75
04:12.727 --> 04:14.447
should we process Dr. Kang's approval

76
04:14.487 --> 04:15.327
first?

77
04:15.568 --> 04:16.168
No need.

78
04:17.008 --> 04:18.327
Company funds are tight now.

79
04:18.887 --> 04:20.368
Jinghua gets top priority.

80
04:20.647 --> 04:21.087
By the way,

81
04:21.967 --> 04:23.048
as your instructions,

82
04:23.373 --> 04:23.847
(Resignation Form)

83
04:23.847 --> 04:25.368
for the sake of the company,

84
04:25.847 --> 04:27.128
I completely offended Ms. Yu

85
04:27.168 --> 04:27.928
this time.

86
04:28.048 --> 04:29.128
She wants to fire me.

87
04:29.568 --> 04:30.128
Don't worry.

88
04:31.128 --> 04:31.887
You report

89
04:32.207 --> 04:33.128
directly to me.

90
04:34.608 --> 04:35.207
Okay.

91
04:35.488 --> 04:36.287
I'm out then.

92
04:45.207 --> 04:46.087
I'm truly sorry,

93
04:46.128 --> 04:46.688
Dr. Kang.

94
04:47.207 --> 04:48.407
Please give me some time.

95
04:58.527 --> 04:59.608
Is everything ready?

96
05:00.767 --> 05:01.368
Remember,

97
05:02.407 --> 05:04.568
push Yu Meng until she completely breaks down.

98
05:04.728 --> 05:06.128
Meng is in a dilemma.

99
05:06.327 --> 05:07.887
Can you give her a bit more time?

100
05:08.287 --> 05:09.647
We'll definitely be grateful.

101
05:12.407 --> 05:13.048
I'm hungry.

102
05:13.967 --> 05:15.207
I'll make you something to eat.

103
05:23.008 --> 05:24.287
What do you usually eat?

104
05:24.967 --> 05:25.688
Takeout.

105
05:30.647 --> 05:31.207
Let's go.

106
05:32.608 --> 05:33.287
Where to?

107
05:47.248 --> 05:48.568
When did you grab this?

108
05:50.608 --> 05:51.928
I thought Chestnut would like it.

109
05:52.603 --> 05:54.399
(Anpanman Cookies)

110
06:10.688 --> 06:11.407
Eat up.

111
06:47.407 --> 06:48.488
School is about to over.

112
06:49.168 --> 06:50.134
Let's pick up Chestnut.

113
06:50.407 --> 06:50.967
Sure.

114
06:55.008 --> 06:55.688
As for Yu Meng,

115
06:56.767 --> 06:57.368
I saw her

116
06:57.407 --> 06:58.407
arguing with Wu Heng.

117
06:59.008 --> 06:59.728
She's trying hard

118
06:59.767 --> 07:00.488
to resolve it.

119
07:01.087 --> 07:02.287
I can give her more time,

120
07:02.928 --> 07:03.728
but at the office,

121
07:03.967 --> 07:05.248
I have to show my attitude.

122
07:06.847 --> 07:08.447
Your acting was pretty convincing.

123
07:09.928 --> 07:10.928
I thank you for her.

124
07:27.568 --> 07:28.368
Look at you.

125
07:28.647 --> 07:29.368
Hit a wall again?

126
07:35.967 --> 07:36.808
Di Liren sent Wu Heng

127
07:36.887 --> 07:38.008
to the Finance

128
07:38.568 --> 07:39.847
to replace Mr. Dong.

129
07:40.647 --> 07:41.368
And he cut off

130
07:41.407 --> 07:42.447
the funding for the lab.

131
07:42.647 --> 07:44.128
I have the signing authority,

132
07:44.368 --> 07:45.527
but if Finance disapproves,

133
07:45.608 --> 07:46.488
I can't do anything.

134
07:48.048 --> 07:49.248
Di Liren doesn't

135
07:49.327 --> 07:50.248
hide anymore,

136
07:50.688 --> 07:51.608
and plays it straight.

137
07:52.128 --> 07:52.967
Exactly.

138
07:54.128 --> 07:55.688
I even used a resignation letter

139
07:55.887 --> 07:57.608
to force Wu Heng.

140
07:57.967 --> 07:59.327
I knew Wu Heng wouldn't sign it,

141
07:59.568 --> 08:00.327
and Di Liren

142
08:00.368 --> 08:01.168
would protect him.

143
08:01.488 --> 08:02.087
But I had to

144
08:02.128 --> 08:03.207
show Dr. Kang

145
08:03.447 --> 08:05.008
my determination to resolve this.

146
08:05.287 --> 08:06.327
What did Liu Zi say?

147
08:06.568 --> 08:09.128
She definitely defends me.

148
08:10.128 --> 08:11.248
She should've talked

149
08:11.287 --> 08:11.928
to Kang Long.

150
08:12.248 --> 08:14.207
Your signing authority becomes useless now.

151
08:14.527 --> 08:15.447
I think Di Liren wants

152
08:15.488 --> 08:16.327
to tell you this.

153
08:17.087 --> 08:17.967
Whatever.

154
08:18.447 --> 08:19.128
I don't care

155
08:19.168 --> 08:20.168
about him anymore.

156
08:22.168 --> 08:23.688
All I want right now is to get

157
08:23.767 --> 08:24.928
the test results for Jinghua.

158
08:25.688 --> 08:26.728
The test results

159
08:26.887 --> 08:28.207
will take at least three days.

160
08:28.327 --> 08:29.688
You must keep your composure.

161
08:30.368 --> 08:31.128
Chips, five yuan.

162
08:31.808 --> 08:32.647
Scan here to pay.

163
08:39.208 --> 08:40.368
Right, and a Coke.

164
08:40.687 --> 08:41.407
Two yuan.

165
08:42.608 --> 08:42.968
You...

166
08:45.088 --> 08:45.767
I don't want it.

167
08:54.407 --> 08:55.407
(Jiali, Pay Us Back) Jiali, pay us back!

168
08:55.887 --> 08:57.128
Jiali, pay us back!

169
08:57.287 --> 08:58.328
Jiali, pay us back!

170
08:58.488 --> 08:59.088
Excuse me.

171
08:59.088 --> 09:00.047
Jiali, pay us back!

172
09:00.608 --> 09:01.407
Jiali, pay us back!

173
09:01.407 --> 09:02.488
Ma'am.

174
09:02.927 --> 09:04.047
What's going on here?

175
09:04.208 --> 09:05.287
You're that Ms. Yu!

176
09:05.767 --> 09:06.368
Pay us back!

177
09:06.807 --> 09:08.128
You're holding our payments!

178
09:09.167 --> 09:10.208
What do you mean?

179
09:10.208 --> 09:10.887
What payments?

180
09:10.968 --> 09:12.208
If you don't pay the factory,

181
09:12.287 --> 09:13.608
and the factory won't pay us.

182
09:13.848 --> 09:14.567
How are us small vendors

183
09:14.567 --> 09:15.488
supposed to survive?

184
09:15.647 --> 09:16.448
Pay us now,

185
09:16.448 --> 09:17.128
or you won't go.

186
09:17.128 --> 09:18.328
Ma'am, let's talk this out.

187
09:20.927 --> 09:22.008
Don't touch me!

188
09:22.047 --> 09:23.328
I've got nothing to lose anyway!

189
09:23.728 --> 09:24.807
You make us do this!

190
09:25.527 --> 09:26.448
Put the knife down,

191
09:26.687 --> 09:27.088
please.

192
09:27.088 --> 09:27.968
Pay us first!

193
09:28.047 --> 09:29.047
Put the knife down first.

194
09:29.287 --> 09:29.767
Let me go.

195
09:30.008 --> 09:31.248
I'll take you upstairs

196
09:31.328 --> 09:32.047
to pay you.

197
09:32.167 --> 09:33.088
I'm not going with you.

198
09:33.407 --> 09:34.368
Everyone's here.

199
09:34.728 --> 09:36.208
I need them to witness this.

200
09:36.488 --> 09:37.208
You make the call.

201
09:44.448 --> 09:45.088
Ma'am,

202
09:45.368 --> 09:46.208
listen to me.

203
09:46.767 --> 09:48.167
Security already called the police.

204
09:48.407 --> 09:49.527
The police will arrive soon.

205
09:49.807 --> 09:51.167
I won't withhold your money.

206
09:52.287 --> 09:53.567
Just put the knife down.

207
09:53.687 --> 09:54.287
Let me go.

208
09:54.488 --> 09:55.567
I'll take you upstairs

209
09:55.647 --> 09:56.647
to pay you,

210
09:57.047 --> 09:57.527
okay?

211
09:57.767 --> 09:59.088
If I'm lying to you,

212
09:59.287 --> 10:00.208
you can come every day.

213
10:04.728 --> 10:05.328
Let go!

214
10:05.328 --> 10:06.248
- What are you doing? - Hey, what are you doing?

215
10:06.328 --> 10:07.167
- Don't move! - Don't move!

216
10:19.128 --> 10:19.687
Be careful.

217
10:34.328 --> 10:35.608
Did he think I would give up

218
10:35.687 --> 10:37.167
the signing authority over this?

219
10:37.968 --> 10:39.088
Never.

220
10:39.407 --> 10:40.647
Di Liren is so shameless.

221
10:40.887 --> 10:41.848
He's more despicable

222
10:41.968 --> 10:42.767
than I imagined.

223
10:43.047 --> 10:44.328
Just let your imagination run

224
10:44.807 --> 10:45.927
even wilder with him.

225
10:46.287 --> 10:46.848
How is it?

226
10:47.088 --> 10:47.807
Are you okay?

227
10:50.848 --> 10:51.728
It stinks.

228
10:52.407 --> 10:53.608
The smell still lingers.

229
10:53.968 --> 10:54.608
Smell this.

230
10:55.047 --> 10:55.887
I'll pass.

231
10:57.248 --> 10:58.248
Take this first.

232
10:58.687 --> 10:59.527
Don't collapse before

233
10:59.608 --> 11:00.488
the real deal begins.

234
11:01.488 --> 11:02.848
What's this?

235
11:03.088 --> 11:04.008
I'd like some too.

236
11:04.047 --> 11:04.728
What for?

237
11:04.927 --> 11:05.683
Get to the point.

238
11:05.848 --> 11:06.567
Right. Meng,

239
11:07.047 --> 11:07.927
the test results...

240
11:08.887 --> 11:09.968
Keep your voice down.

241
11:10.608 --> 11:11.848
The test results are out.

242
11:17.538 --> 11:19.096
(Test Report)

243
11:21.128 --> 11:22.287
The key active ingredient,

244
11:22.527 --> 11:23.647
hydroxytyrosol,

245
11:23.767 --> 11:25.128
wasn't detected at all.

246
11:25.368 --> 11:26.876
And preservatives exceeded the limit.

247
11:27.647 --> 11:28.887
That's so outrageous.

248
11:29.328 --> 11:29.968
It's the product

249
11:30.047 --> 11:31.167
Jiali is promoting hard.

250
11:31.407 --> 11:32.008
Can this report

251
11:32.088 --> 11:33.167
put Di Liren and Han Guang

252
11:33.248 --> 11:34.128
behind bars?

253
11:35.368 --> 11:35.968
No.

254
11:36.887 --> 11:38.008
Private testing carries

255
11:38.128 --> 11:39.047
little legal weight.

256
11:39.887 --> 11:40.448
Besides,

257
11:40.608 --> 11:42.128
this report can only be a lead,

258
11:42.248 --> 11:43.088
not a proof of guilt.

259
11:43.368 --> 11:44.167
Di Liren can claim

260
11:44.167 --> 11:45.248
the sample got tampered.

261
11:46.047 --> 11:47.488
We need stronger evidence

262
11:47.647 --> 11:48.488
to prove Di Liren

263
11:48.567 --> 11:49.368
is related to this.

264
11:49.647 --> 11:50.328
Bai,

265
11:51.728 --> 11:52.728
your clothes fit well.

266
11:57.728 --> 11:58.328
Meng,

267
11:58.807 --> 11:59.887
is your work

268
12:00.488 --> 12:01.328
that dangerous?

269
12:02.328 --> 12:03.088
Not at all.

270
12:03.767 --> 12:04.608
It was just today.

271
12:04.728 --> 12:05.608
And you ran into it.

272
12:06.448 --> 12:06.848
Harry,

273
12:07.767 --> 12:08.767
about today,

274
12:09.128 --> 12:09.848
thank you.

275
12:12.728 --> 12:13.248
Meng,

276
12:13.968 --> 12:14.567
I'm sorry.

277
12:15.407 --> 12:16.287
What's this about?

278
12:16.767 --> 12:17.687
Why apologize?

279
12:17.968 --> 12:19.047
I have a friend.

280
12:19.608 --> 12:20.287
His parents are

281
12:20.368 --> 12:21.088
quite in love,

282
12:21.167 --> 12:22.167
but he just discovered

283
12:23.128 --> 12:24.448
his dad started another family

284
12:24.968 --> 12:26.088
with a new identity.

285
12:27.567 --> 12:29.088
His parents kept it from him

286
12:30.407 --> 12:31.848
probably to protect him.

287
12:34.807 --> 12:36.248
Did your friend

288
12:37.527 --> 12:38.527
never notice

289
12:38.647 --> 12:39.527
any signs?

290
12:40.887 --> 12:41.647
A while ago,

291
12:42.328 --> 12:43.128
his parents even

292
12:43.167 --> 12:44.167
talked about emigration.

293
12:44.927 --> 12:45.728
What does he think?

294
12:46.088 --> 12:47.407
He just wants the truth.

295
12:49.448 --> 12:51.047
But is knowing the truth good?

296
12:51.608 --> 12:52.368
You have to know,

297
12:53.128 --> 12:54.008
in any relationship,

298
12:54.807 --> 12:56.008
once trust is broken,

299
12:56.968 --> 12:58.488
it can never go back to how it was.

300
12:58.807 --> 12:59.807
What if that truth

301
13:00.008 --> 13:01.167
is tied to his future plans,

302
13:01.567 --> 13:02.687
his hopes and dreams

303
13:02.807 --> 13:03.767
that he never gives up?

304
13:04.807 --> 13:05.407
Once he learns

305
13:05.407 --> 13:06.848
the truth,

306
13:07.368 --> 13:08.728
his dreams might be

307
13:09.128 --> 13:10.128
shattered.

308
13:11.527 --> 13:12.248
Knowing the truth

309
13:13.527 --> 13:14.647
is more important than

310
13:15.368 --> 13:16.128
chasing dreams.

311
13:17.728 --> 13:18.407
Really?

312
13:24.448 --> 13:25.608
Do you want to come to Jiali

313
13:25.807 --> 13:26.807
and be my assistant?

314
13:30.287 --> 13:30.848
This way.

315
13:35.527 --> 13:36.088
Ding,

316
13:38.008 --> 13:39.047
this is my new assistant,

317
13:39.047 --> 13:39.608
Harry.

318
13:40.088 --> 13:41.687
Get him onboarded with HR.

319
13:41.848 --> 13:43.968
You're the guy who blocked that dirty water

320
13:44.088 --> 13:45.527
for Meng, right?

321
13:46.887 --> 13:47.448
Yes.

322
13:47.848 --> 13:48.647
This is...

323
13:50.167 --> 13:51.208
This is my new assistant,

324
13:51.527 --> 13:52.208
Harry.

325
13:53.767 --> 13:54.368
Honey,

326
13:54.807 --> 13:55.527
why didn't I know

327
13:55.527 --> 13:56.927
you needed an assistant?

328
13:58.047 --> 13:59.008
Harry doesn't seem

329
13:59.167 --> 14:00.567
to have a media background.

330
14:01.128 --> 14:02.287
I could find you someone

331
14:02.567 --> 14:03.407
more qualified

332
14:03.448 --> 14:04.368
and experienced.

333
14:07.047 --> 14:07.647
Mr. Di,

334
14:08.088 --> 14:09.328
during the livestream that day,

335
14:09.407 --> 14:10.248
you praised Harry

336
14:10.407 --> 14:11.488
for being quick-witted

337
14:11.567 --> 14:12.807
and smart.

338
14:14.608 --> 14:15.287
So I think

339
14:15.448 --> 14:16.167
he is a better fit

340
14:16.647 --> 14:17.927
for my assistant.

341
14:18.608 --> 14:19.248
Harry,

342
14:19.687 --> 14:20.887
want to be my assistant?

343
14:22.167 --> 14:23.767
I may not have a media background,

344
14:23.927 --> 14:24.328
but

345
14:24.807 --> 14:26.287
I'd love to learn from Meng.

346
14:30.647 --> 14:31.608
Good luck with your job.

347
14:33.527 --> 14:34.248
By the way, Meng,

348
14:35.088 --> 14:36.088
Mr. Tian is waiting

349
14:36.407 --> 14:37.767
for you in the office.

350
14:40.608 --> 14:41.848
At such a critical moment,

351
14:42.488 --> 14:43.848
with such a huge mess,

352
14:44.208 --> 14:45.728
that'd ruin Jiali's reputation.

353
14:47.167 --> 14:48.047
I'm sorry, Mr. Tian.

354
14:48.807 --> 14:49.968
I'll handle this.

355
14:51.767 --> 14:53.368
You insisted on handling it,

356
14:53.407 --> 14:54.407
so things lost control.

357
14:54.927 --> 14:55.488
Jiali contains

358
14:55.527 --> 14:56.807
our years of hard work.

359
14:57.488 --> 14:58.368
If you feel

360
14:59.248 --> 15:00.368
overwhelmed,

361
15:00.887 --> 15:02.026
hand your signing authority

362
15:02.527 --> 15:03.328
over to Liren.

363
15:05.767 --> 15:06.368
Mr. Tian.

364
15:07.008 --> 15:07.527
Enough.

365
15:07.927 --> 15:08.687
Don't come

366
15:09.287 --> 15:10.287
for a while.

367
15:10.848 --> 15:12.047
Go home and get some rest.

368
15:12.287 --> 15:13.208
Liren will take care of

369
15:14.608 --> 15:15.728
everything from now on.

370
15:36.088 --> 15:37.887
(The situation has changed. Send it now.)

371
15:40.159 --> 15:42.784
(Jinghua's Test Report)

372
15:45.287 --> 15:47.047
I received an anonymous email.

373
15:47.728 --> 15:48.968
It's Jinghua's test report.

374
15:49.488 --> 15:50.208
I got it too.

375
15:50.287 --> 15:50.927
Me too.

376
15:54.488 --> 15:56.167
There is a problem with Jinghua.

377
15:57.448 --> 15:59.368
Mr. Di is in charge of Jinghua.

378
15:59.728 --> 16:00.728
Could he be...

379
16:01.208 --> 16:01.728
No way.

380
16:01.968 --> 16:03.608
He's never done this.

381
16:03.687 --> 16:04.728
I just received

382
16:04.807 --> 16:05.647
an anonymous email

383
16:06.287 --> 16:07.567
with a Jinghua's test report.

384
16:07.767 --> 16:09.368
I wonder if you received it.

385
16:10.008 --> 16:11.407
It says we faked Jinghua's ingredients,

386
16:11.407 --> 16:12.407
and its preservatives exceeded.

387
16:12.407 --> 16:13.767
I know there are many rumors

388
16:13.968 --> 16:15.608
about Jinghua lately.

389
16:16.608 --> 16:17.647
But today,

390
16:17.968 --> 16:19.328
I want to make a formal statement.

391
16:19.887 --> 16:20.527
All of these

392
16:20.687 --> 16:21.448
are completely

393
16:21.488 --> 16:22.887
unfounded rumors.

394
16:25.167 --> 16:26.328
To prove our innocence,

395
16:27.008 --> 16:27.927
Jiali will conduct

396
16:28.208 --> 16:29.248
a full internal inspection

397
16:29.287 --> 16:30.448
regarding Jinghua.

398
16:31.167 --> 16:32.807
If we find any issues,

399
16:33.208 --> 16:34.608
we'll hold them accountable.

400
16:35.208 --> 16:35.927
Mr. Di

401
16:36.167 --> 16:37.767
is in charge of Jinghua.

402
16:37.887 --> 16:38.647
Right.

403
16:38.807 --> 16:39.687
Exactly.

404
16:39.848 --> 16:40.328
Right.

405
16:40.848 --> 16:42.608
Mr. Di is in charge of Jinghua.

406
16:43.527 --> 16:44.887
So this is very likely

407
16:44.927 --> 16:46.167
a tactic used by

408
16:46.567 --> 16:47.527
our competitors

409
16:47.728 --> 16:49.208
to smear Jiali or Mr. Di.

410
16:51.567 --> 16:52.208
I believe

411
16:52.608 --> 16:53.807
Mr. Di is innocent.

412
16:54.368 --> 16:55.968
- So do we. - So do we.

413
17:00.527 --> 17:02.248
Without definitive proof,

414
17:02.887 --> 17:03.567
we can't suspect

415
17:03.608 --> 17:04.607
any of our own people.

416
17:05.087 --> 17:06.488
But to uncover the truth,

417
17:07.047 --> 17:08.087
Mr. Di must

418
17:08.448 --> 17:09.248
cooperate with

419
17:10.127 --> 17:11.008
the investigation.

420
17:12.847 --> 17:14.648
Without definitive proof,

421
17:15.127 --> 17:15.928
we can't suspect

422
17:15.928 --> 17:16.928
any of our own people.

423
17:17.968 --> 17:19.208
But to uncover the truth,

424
17:19.888 --> 17:20.888
Mr. Dong

425
17:21.087 --> 17:21.807
must

426
17:22.527 --> 17:23.367
step down for now.

427
17:28.367 --> 17:29.688
(General Manager, Han Guang) What is going on?

428
17:31.008 --> 17:31.807
How did our company

429
17:31.888 --> 17:33.327
receive this test report too?

430
17:34.087 --> 17:34.928
I'll handle it.

431
17:35.367 --> 17:36.287
It's all taken care of.

432
17:36.408 --> 17:37.847
I don't care how you handle it,

433
17:38.287 --> 17:39.008
but don't forget,

434
17:39.527 --> 17:41.008
tomorrow is the deadline.

435
17:43.367 --> 17:43.767
Relax.

436
17:44.168 --> 17:45.064
Meet at the usual place.

437
17:56.527 --> 17:57.047
Hello?

438
17:57.847 --> 17:59.287
Yu Meng hired Haoyu.

439
17:59.767 --> 18:00.928
Han Guang is pressing me.

440
18:01.767 --> 18:02.208
Now,

441
18:02.367 --> 18:03.607
you must stand united with me.

442
18:04.327 --> 18:05.287
Let's get rid of her.

443
18:05.767 --> 18:07.168
To get rid of Yu Meng,

444
18:07.287 --> 18:08.527
we have to use Jinghua.

445
18:09.448 --> 18:10.628
I'll keep Han Guang in check.

446
18:11.127 --> 18:12.248
You transfer me the money.

447
18:13.567 --> 18:14.688
Have you spent that money

448
18:14.688 --> 18:16.047
on investments or real estate?

449
18:17.127 --> 18:17.968
Are you sure

450
18:18.127 --> 18:19.248
you can keep him in check?

451
18:19.928 --> 18:21.728
This is our only option now.

452
18:22.847 --> 18:23.527
Let me think.

453
18:29.127 --> 18:30.688
You weren't the liaison with Jiali,

454
18:30.928 --> 18:32.327
nor did you sign the contract.

455
18:32.607 --> 18:33.807
And you're not the direct head

456
18:33.928 --> 18:34.567
of the factory.

457
18:34.567 --> 18:35.567
If anything goes wrong,

458
18:35.928 --> 18:37.327
you're just a victim.

459
18:37.928 --> 18:39.408
Keep a close eye on Jiali.

460
18:39.968 --> 18:40.968
Whenever things change,

461
18:41.527 --> 18:42.448
cut ties with them.

462
18:43.087 --> 18:43.968
Okay, understood.

463
18:46.648 --> 18:47.527
Mr. Di.

464
18:53.448 --> 18:54.008
Hey,

465
18:54.807 --> 18:55.527
who are you?

466
18:55.968 --> 18:56.688
Wrong room?

467
18:57.008 --> 18:58.327
If you're Han Guang,

468
18:59.087 --> 18:59.968
I'm in the right room.

469
19:00.248 --> 19:00.968
Who are you?

470
19:01.968 --> 19:02.928
We haven't met,

471
19:04.527 --> 19:05.728
but you should know me.

472
19:06.728 --> 19:07.567
I know

473
19:08.248 --> 19:09.928
all about you and Di Liren.

474
19:17.767 --> 19:19.408
Every time you wire money to Di Liren,

475
19:20.287 --> 19:22.047
the account ending in 304

476
19:22.448 --> 19:23.248
is mine.

477
19:24.367 --> 19:25.448
Who are you to him?

478
19:27.928 --> 19:29.248
It doesn't matter.

479
19:30.087 --> 19:30.607
What matters

480
19:30.607 --> 19:31.928
is you need Di Liren's money,

481
19:32.168 --> 19:33.607
and his money is with me.

482
19:34.327 --> 19:34.728
Here,

483
19:35.168 --> 19:36.047
cakes!

484
19:36.168 --> 19:37.087
Thank you.

485
19:46.527 --> 19:47.248
What's wrong?

486
19:47.728 --> 19:48.248
Eat up.

487
19:51.287 --> 19:52.688
I don't think Di Liren

488
19:53.127 --> 19:54.327
would wait around to die.

489
19:54.648 --> 19:55.527
I agree.

490
19:56.567 --> 19:57.728
He must be plotting,

491
19:58.607 --> 19:59.287
but we don't know

492
19:59.287 --> 20:00.208
what it is yet.

493
20:07.527 --> 20:08.287
Let me share

494
20:08.327 --> 20:09.047
some great news!

495
20:09.168 --> 20:10.127
I just landed

496
20:10.168 --> 20:11.367
a brand deal with a high pay.

497
20:11.567 --> 20:12.807
Look, the deposit just came in.

498
20:14.367 --> 20:15.008
Nice!

499
20:15.168 --> 20:15.888
You're great!

500
20:16.527 --> 20:17.448
That's a lot of money.

501
20:17.888 --> 20:18.928
I'm rich now.

502
20:24.087 --> 20:24.807
Sorry, I'm late.

503
20:25.208 --> 20:25.847
Traffic jams.

504
20:26.248 --> 20:26.928
Mr. Di.

505
20:27.287 --> 20:28.127
Well, well.

506
20:28.567 --> 20:29.728
You have an advisor hidden.

507
20:31.327 --> 20:32.287
But you still

508
20:32.408 --> 20:33.607
found her, didn't you?

509
20:34.928 --> 20:35.527
Where were you?

510
20:35.807 --> 20:36.648
How to help you.

511
20:39.527 --> 20:40.248
It's settled.

512
20:41.527 --> 20:42.408
I'm off now.

513
20:42.888 --> 20:43.928
This is freshly brewed.

514
20:45.488 --> 20:46.087
It takes time

515
20:46.488 --> 20:48.047
for tea to reveal its sweet aftertaste.

516
20:55.287 --> 20:56.008
Why are you here?

517
20:56.527 --> 20:57.928
If you want money from me,

518
20:58.888 --> 21:00.607
I need to know what's going on first.

519
21:05.087 --> 21:06.168
The top priority right now

520
21:06.488 --> 21:07.607
is keeping Haoyu in check.

521
21:08.087 --> 21:09.168
We can't let him stay

522
21:09.208 --> 21:10.008
by Yu Meng's side.

523
21:13.727 --> 21:14.767
(What if your parents hide a lot from you?)

524
21:14.767 --> 21:15.168
Thursday,

525
21:15.168 --> 21:16.431
you'll go to Beijing for a follow-up.

526
21:19.008 --> 21:19.488
(I've decided. I'll look into it myself first.) Right.

527
21:21.047 --> 21:21.767
But I feel like

528
21:21.847 --> 21:22.807
I've recovered well.

529
21:23.168 --> 21:23.888
I don't need to go

530
21:23.888 --> 21:24.728
to Beijing anymore.

531
21:25.168 --> 21:25.767
Maybe

532
21:25.847 --> 21:26.287
we can

533
21:26.287 --> 21:27.367
go to a local hospital.

534
21:27.728 --> 21:28.327
No way.

535
21:29.367 --> 21:30.208
You were treated

536
21:30.248 --> 21:30.888
in Beijing.

537
21:31.688 --> 21:32.367
Dr. Zhou knows

538
21:32.367 --> 21:33.248
your medical history.

539
21:34.208 --> 21:34.767
I only trust

540
21:34.847 --> 21:35.728
him.

541
21:36.607 --> 21:37.488
If you refuse,

542
21:37.648 --> 21:38.728
I'll escort you to Beijing.

543
21:39.248 --> 21:39.648
Don't.

544
21:40.367 --> 21:41.648
Don't trouble yourself.

545
21:41.928 --> 21:42.567
I'll go.

546
21:43.728 --> 21:44.688
That's my son.

547
21:45.208 --> 21:46.527
I've booked your flight.

548
21:47.047 --> 21:48.047
Give these records

549
21:48.047 --> 21:48.847
to Dr. Zhou.

550
21:49.688 --> 21:50.648
If the test results

551
21:50.767 --> 21:51.807
are good,

552
21:55.287 --> 21:56.488
I have a task for you.

553
21:57.327 --> 21:58.008
A task?

554
21:58.488 --> 21:59.127
What task?

555
21:59.527 --> 21:59.928
Remember

556
22:00.008 --> 22:00.688
our old house

557
22:00.767 --> 22:01.767
back in Xiaocheng?

558
22:03.488 --> 22:04.527
I bought it back.

559
22:06.688 --> 22:07.807
I remember how reluctant

560
22:08.047 --> 22:09.527
you were to leave there.

561
22:09.648 --> 22:11.408
I thought to myself,

562
22:11.648 --> 22:12.688
when I could manage it,

563
22:13.208 --> 22:13.968
I'd buy that house

564
22:14.047 --> 22:14.807
back.

565
22:15.408 --> 22:16.567
It just so happened the owner

566
22:16.607 --> 22:17.607
put it on the market,

567
22:18.327 --> 22:19.087
so I bought it.

568
22:19.807 --> 22:20.928
That way, the three of us

569
22:20.968 --> 22:21.767
can have a home

570
22:21.888 --> 22:22.807
when we go back.

571
22:23.648 --> 22:24.888
All it needs now is renovation.

572
22:25.248 --> 22:25.928
Maybe

573
22:26.728 --> 22:27.847
you could go back

574
22:28.408 --> 22:29.327
and take care of it.

575
22:31.168 --> 22:32.648
That's a huge project.

576
22:33.327 --> 22:33.847
But

577
22:34.047 --> 22:34.928
I need inspiration

578
22:34.968 --> 22:35.688
to take it on.

579
22:36.087 --> 22:36.728
Otherwise,

580
22:36.968 --> 22:38.168
it'll ruin my reputation,

581
22:38.448 --> 22:39.008
right?

582
22:41.567 --> 22:42.208
True.

583
22:43.807 --> 22:44.968
I'll pack your things first.

584
22:51.888 --> 22:52.527
Okay.

585
22:55.928 --> 22:57.208
Call me when you arrive.

586
22:57.968 --> 22:58.567
Don't worry.

587
22:58.688 --> 22:59.767
I'll call you every day.

588
23:00.248 --> 23:01.168
Eat properly, okay?

589
23:02.367 --> 23:02.767
Go.

590
23:04.928 --> 23:05.488
I'm leaving.

591
23:05.527 --> 23:05.767
Go on.

592
23:06.607 --> 23:07.488
Drive safe, sir.

593
23:14.807 --> 23:15.248
Hello?

594
23:15.928 --> 23:16.648
Did Haoyu leave?

595
23:17.408 --> 23:17.847
Just left.

596
23:18.367 --> 23:19.448
You get the hang of it.

597
23:19.767 --> 23:20.968
Cut the flattery.

598
23:21.648 --> 23:22.287
I'm telling you,

599
23:23.248 --> 23:24.728
even if we can't leave unscathed

600
23:25.208 --> 23:26.408
and must fight to the death,

601
23:26.488 --> 23:27.248
I can accept that.

602
23:27.847 --> 23:28.567
But I can't let

603
23:28.607 --> 23:29.527
her to use Haoyu again.

604
23:31.127 --> 23:32.287
The life Haoyu has now

605
23:32.527 --> 23:33.327
is the life

606
23:33.367 --> 23:34.488
he was always meant to have.

607
23:36.208 --> 23:36.968
He can't go back

608
23:37.008 --> 23:38.087
to that old life anymore.

609
23:38.448 --> 23:38.847
Alright.

610
23:39.488 --> 23:40.047
This time,

611
23:40.567 --> 23:41.888
I have a permanent solution.

612
23:42.807 --> 23:43.488
Even if she wants

613
23:43.488 --> 23:44.607
to go against us,

614
23:44.968 --> 23:46.127
she won't have the power.

615
23:50.168 --> 23:50.767
(Wuyou Moving) Excuse me.

616
23:51.087 --> 23:51.607
Excuse me.

617
23:52.087 --> 23:53.208
What are you doing?

618
23:54.047 --> 23:54.688
Ms. Yu,

619
23:54.807 --> 23:55.287
right?

620
23:56.047 --> 23:57.688
We're from Wuyou Moving Company.

621
23:57.847 --> 23:58.888
Happy to be of service.

622
23:59.168 --> 23:59.928
Moving company?

623
24:01.607 --> 24:03.047
No one needs to move here.

624
24:05.327 --> 24:06.448
Building 8, right?

625
24:06.607 --> 24:07.607
Check if this is

626
24:07.607 --> 24:08.888
your number and address.

627
24:12.847 --> 24:13.488
Just a moment.

628
24:13.688 --> 24:14.047
Sure.

629
24:18.791 --> 24:22.286
(Di Liren)

630
24:25.968 --> 24:26.728
The info is right,

631
24:27.127 --> 24:28.087
but I'd like to know

632
24:28.448 --> 24:29.168
who ordered this.

633
24:29.807 --> 24:30.847
It's okay then.

634
24:30.928 --> 24:31.648
Where should we

635
24:31.728 --> 24:32.287
start moving?

636
24:33.127 --> 24:33.888
Let's go in.

637
24:33.968 --> 24:34.408
Come on.

638
24:34.767 --> 24:35.928
I never ordered a move.

639
24:36.208 --> 24:36.888
Don't go in.

640
24:36.968 --> 24:38.047
Security, stop them!

641
24:38.847 --> 24:39.527
Stop right there!

642
24:39.567 --> 24:39.968
Stop it.

643
24:40.047 --> 24:40.888
Get out!

644
24:41.607 --> 24:42.168
Get out!

645
24:42.408 --> 24:43.327
What is going on here?

646
24:45.888 --> 24:46.607
Ms. Yu,

647
24:47.448 --> 24:48.847
we normally don't provide

648
24:48.968 --> 24:49.807
night service.

649
24:50.168 --> 24:50.888
We only came

650
24:50.888 --> 24:52.527
at this hour

651
24:52.567 --> 24:53.648
after confirming

652
24:53.688 --> 24:54.168
with you.

653
24:54.688 --> 24:56.087
You can't go back on your word.

654
24:56.327 --> 24:56.847
Ms. Yu,

655
24:57.208 --> 24:58.567
maybe check if your family

656
24:58.888 --> 24:59.888
ordered this.

657
25:01.168 --> 25:02.448
I make all the decisions.

658
25:02.648 --> 25:03.847
No one needs to move.

659
25:05.767 --> 25:07.527
If you really don't want to move, fine.

660
25:07.607 --> 25:08.607
As we're already here,

661
25:08.928 --> 25:09.847
you need to pay us.

662
25:10.527 --> 25:11.408
In the dead of night,

663
25:11.448 --> 25:12.488
why moving out?

664
25:13.047 --> 25:13.847
Did she go bankrupt?

665
25:14.448 --> 25:15.008
Meng,

666
25:15.327 --> 25:16.807
why are you suddenly moving?

667
25:17.127 --> 25:18.448
I'm not. Everyone,

668
25:18.728 --> 25:19.607
they made a mistake.

669
25:21.168 --> 25:22.448
Why do I need to pay you?

670
25:22.648 --> 25:24.168
Go ask whoever placed the order.

671
25:24.208 --> 25:25.168
Trying to blackmail me?

672
25:25.287 --> 25:25.847
Get lost,

673
25:25.928 --> 25:26.847
or I'll call the cops.

674
25:26.928 --> 25:28.168
Call them then, Ms. Yu.

675
25:28.648 --> 25:29.767
We came here for an order,

676
25:29.847 --> 25:30.648
completely legally.

677
25:30.968 --> 25:32.408
Anyway, it's 100 yuan per man,

678
25:32.448 --> 25:33.168
600 for the truck.

679
25:33.168 --> 25:33.688
Pay us now,

680
25:33.968 --> 25:35.208
or we won't leave.

681
25:35.527 --> 25:36.567
We'll have to wait here.

682
25:37.008 --> 25:37.688
Wait right here.

683
25:37.928 --> 25:38.728
We're not leaving.

684
25:38.888 --> 25:39.327
Wait here.

685
25:42.168 --> 25:42.968
Sit down and wait.

686
25:43.131 --> 25:46.598
(Di Liren)

687
25:48.527 --> 25:49.208
Hello, honey?

688
25:50.248 --> 25:51.567
Did you call the movers?

689
25:52.008 --> 25:53.047
What movers?

690
25:53.488 --> 25:55.168
Someone hired movers,

691
25:55.248 --> 25:56.567
and a bunch of men came.

692
25:57.248 --> 25:58.208
You didn't call

693
25:58.928 --> 25:59.847
to tell me that?

694
26:00.688 --> 26:01.728
I wanted to tell you

695
26:01.888 --> 26:03.327
that Jinghua's test report is out.

696
26:03.488 --> 26:04.448
I'm afraid you'll worry,

697
26:04.567 --> 26:05.928
so I forwarded it right away.

698
26:08.252 --> 26:09.878
(Jinghua's Test Report)

699
26:13.158 --> 26:16.095
(Pass)

700
26:26.287 --> 26:27.847
You really have your ways.

701
26:28.408 --> 26:29.607
As long as we align

702
26:30.248 --> 26:31.408
on the Jinghua project,

703
26:31.567 --> 26:33.208
who could possibly find fault with it?

704
26:33.688 --> 26:34.688
Luckily, you notified

705
26:34.807 --> 26:36.168
Lin Qiang in time

706
26:36.367 --> 26:38.127
to swap out the test samples,

707
26:38.488 --> 26:39.488
or it'd cause trouble.

708
26:40.488 --> 26:41.847
But why did you call the movers

709
26:41.968 --> 26:43.047
to your house

710
26:43.127 --> 26:43.847
at this hour?

711
26:44.807 --> 26:46.607
Aim for where it hurts most.

712
26:47.567 --> 26:48.688
I can't let her keep

713
26:48.807 --> 26:49.807
stirring up trouble.

714
26:51.367 --> 26:52.208
If she becomes

715
26:52.248 --> 26:53.567
someone with mental illness,

716
26:54.327 --> 26:55.688
who would ever believe

717
26:56.087 --> 26:57.248
anything she says?

718
27:00.807 --> 27:01.488
Liren,

719
27:02.448 --> 27:03.567
I heard rumors

720
27:04.008 --> 27:05.488
that Jiali went bankrupt,

721
27:06.248 --> 27:07.127
you and Meng

722
27:07.367 --> 27:09.408
tried to skip town in the middle of the night.

723
27:10.488 --> 27:11.888
This is a misunderstanding.

724
27:15.567 --> 27:16.807
See what you've done.

725
27:17.728 --> 27:18.367
Meng asked me

726
27:18.367 --> 27:19.567
to hire the movers.

727
27:20.127 --> 27:20.767
Alright.

728
27:21.127 --> 27:22.607
Don't mention this again.

729
27:24.567 --> 27:25.448
Checked Dad's temperature

730
27:25.448 --> 27:26.408
and blood pressure?

731
27:26.688 --> 27:27.488
All normal.

732
27:30.527 --> 27:31.527
Here's the report.

733
27:32.728 --> 27:33.248
By the way,

734
27:33.448 --> 27:34.648
Meng left behind the meds

735
27:34.648 --> 27:35.767
from her psychiatry visit.

736
27:38.327 --> 27:39.287
Psychiatry?

737
27:39.642 --> 27:43.949
(Lithium Carbonate Tablets)

738
27:46.008 --> 27:46.847
What's up with her?

739
27:48.448 --> 27:49.168
Nothing.

740
27:51.127 --> 27:51.928
What happened?

741
27:52.648 --> 27:53.408
Tell me the truth.

742
27:54.008 --> 27:54.688
Ms. Hui,

743
27:55.168 --> 27:56.248
go fetch some hot water.

744
27:56.488 --> 27:57.047
Okay.

745
28:07.087 --> 28:08.168
Meng does have

746
28:10.888 --> 28:12.008
an issue in that area.

747
28:12.567 --> 28:13.168
It's my fault

748
28:13.847 --> 28:14.767
for neglecting her.

749
28:14.888 --> 28:15.688
She was fine.

750
28:16.127 --> 28:17.408
Why would she have this issue?

751
28:18.847 --> 28:20.087
I thought she was just

752
28:20.127 --> 28:21.327
throwing some temper.

753
28:22.688 --> 28:23.888
Then Dad fell ill.

754
28:24.607 --> 28:25.928
One day, I worked late

755
28:26.047 --> 28:27.047
and came a bit late.

756
28:27.807 --> 28:28.928
But Meng caused a scene

757
28:29.008 --> 28:30.047
right here,

758
28:30.367 --> 28:31.208
smashing things

759
28:31.248 --> 28:32.168
and throwing chairs.

760
28:32.607 --> 28:33.807
She insisted I cheated on her,

761
28:34.168 --> 28:35.448
and asked Dad to fire me,

762
28:36.127 --> 28:37.327
so she could be the chairman.

763
28:38.408 --> 28:39.008
What?

764
28:39.847 --> 28:40.928
That's ridiculous!

765
28:40.928 --> 28:42.287
Yu is still sick.

766
28:43.527 --> 28:45.327
Ms. Hui used to be a nurse.

767
28:46.248 --> 28:47.648
She noticed something's off

768
28:47.928 --> 28:49.408
and told me to get her checked out.

769
28:49.728 --> 28:50.408
Then we learned

770
28:50.728 --> 28:51.888
she is indeed sick.

771
28:52.208 --> 28:53.527
But Meng refuses to take her meds

772
28:53.688 --> 28:55.087
and denies being sick.

773
28:55.648 --> 28:56.728
Multiple times now,

774
28:57.047 --> 28:58.688
she denied things she'd said

775
28:58.807 --> 29:00.248
and forgot things she'd done.

776
29:02.767 --> 29:03.607
I...

777
29:03.688 --> 29:05.567
With my relationship with Yu,

778
29:06.208 --> 29:07.807
Meng is like a daughter to me.

779
29:08.968 --> 29:10.168
I won't just stand by.

780
29:10.767 --> 29:11.488
I'll talk to her.

781
29:12.008 --> 29:12.807
But she doesn't want

782
29:12.968 --> 29:13.648
others to know

783
29:13.767 --> 29:14.567
about her condition.

784
29:14.847 --> 29:15.408
Don't worry.

785
29:16.087 --> 29:16.767
I understand.

786
29:22.888 --> 29:23.448
Mr. Tian,

787
29:24.127 --> 29:25.567
if you didn't ask me to come

788
29:26.287 --> 29:27.527
to talk about work,

789
29:28.248 --> 29:29.087
then...

790
29:29.367 --> 29:30.087
Just have a meal

791
29:30.607 --> 29:31.367
and unwind.

792
29:31.767 --> 29:32.208
What?

793
29:32.367 --> 29:32.888
Can't we?

794
29:34.327 --> 29:35.047
Of course, we can.

795
29:35.448 --> 29:36.607
How is your mom doing lately?

796
29:37.327 --> 29:37.968
Pretty good.

797
29:38.807 --> 29:40.087
We video call every day,

798
29:40.408 --> 29:41.488
and she's much better now.

799
29:41.688 --> 29:42.888
Well, human

800
29:44.008 --> 29:45.008
needs rest.

801
29:46.488 --> 29:47.968
I think you should

802
29:48.327 --> 29:49.287
go to keep her company.

803
29:49.527 --> 29:50.327
Surrounded

804
29:51.127 --> 29:52.928
by mountains and waters,

805
29:53.607 --> 29:54.928
you could reset

806
29:54.928 --> 29:55.928
your body and mind.

807
29:56.648 --> 29:57.208
You might not

808
29:57.367 --> 29:58.488
even need the meds.

809
29:58.648 --> 29:59.127
Meds?

810
30:00.527 --> 30:01.327
What meds?

811
30:06.168 --> 30:06.888
Well,

812
30:07.807 --> 30:09.127
you young people nowadays

813
30:09.928 --> 30:11.847
are getting into wellness,

814
30:12.448 --> 30:14.248
taking all those

815
30:14.287 --> 30:15.607
supplements by the handful.

816
30:18.047 --> 30:18.688
Mr. Tian,

817
30:19.408 --> 30:20.648
did someone

818
30:21.168 --> 30:22.408
tell you something?

819
30:22.847 --> 30:23.408
No.

820
30:24.327 --> 30:25.688
I just remembered

821
30:26.527 --> 30:27.168
that my family

822
30:27.208 --> 30:28.527
went to New Zealand last year.

823
30:29.688 --> 30:30.968
Let me show you some photos.

824
30:32.527 --> 30:33.127
Look.

825
30:35.168 --> 30:37.648
The scenery there is gorgeous.

826
30:38.168 --> 30:38.928
I really think

827
30:39.008 --> 30:40.648
you should take your mom on a trip.

828
30:41.327 --> 30:41.847
Well,

829
30:42.847 --> 30:43.728
I'll send

830
30:43.767 --> 30:44.888
our itinerary last year

831
30:45.008 --> 30:45.728
to you.

832
30:47.168 --> 30:47.928
Thank you.

833
30:48.287 --> 30:49.248
But lately,

834
30:49.527 --> 30:50.448
I don't have the time.

835
30:51.047 --> 30:51.688
What is it, Mom?

836
30:51.888 --> 30:53.448
Did you go for your follow-up today?

837
30:54.287 --> 30:55.287
What did Dr. Zhou say?

838
30:56.408 --> 30:57.047
Don't worry.

839
30:57.248 --> 30:58.127
Everything looks fine.

840
30:58.527 --> 30:58.968
Look.

841
30:59.208 --> 31:00.127
I just stepped out.

842
31:00.648 --> 31:01.008
Look.

843
31:02.847 --> 31:03.287
Good.

844
31:03.807 --> 31:05.047
I also asked Dr. Zhou

845
31:05.127 --> 31:06.807
to give you a full physical checkup.

846
31:07.527 --> 31:08.527
Just do it.

847
31:08.767 --> 31:09.527
Don't rush back.

848
31:09.847 --> 31:11.367
I'll book your return ticket later.

849
31:12.567 --> 31:13.408
Alright, got it.

850
31:13.728 --> 31:14.648
I want to stay

851
31:14.728 --> 31:15.248
a bit longer.

852
31:15.527 --> 31:16.928
Mr. Tian asked me out suddenly.

853
31:17.448 --> 31:18.327
Di Liren must have

854
31:18.367 --> 31:19.168
told him something.

855
31:20.208 --> 31:21.567
Looks like he's terrified

856
31:22.047 --> 31:23.567
I'll take back my signing authority,

857
31:23.767 --> 31:25.047
so he's trying hard to stop me.

858
31:25.367 --> 31:26.767
We need to change our approach.

859
31:27.408 --> 31:28.928
What other excuse do you have

860
31:29.168 --> 31:30.448
to return to Jiali?

861
31:31.327 --> 31:31.928
And Harry?

862
31:32.607 --> 31:33.327
Why no news

863
31:33.367 --> 31:34.047
on Harry lately?

864
31:34.367 --> 31:35.448
In Beijing for a follow-up.

865
31:35.888 --> 31:36.807
He even sent me

866
31:36.928 --> 31:37.928
his medical records.

867
31:40.408 --> 31:41.208
To be honest,

868
31:41.527 --> 31:42.287
with him gone,

869
31:42.728 --> 31:43.688
I worry Lu Hui

870
31:43.728 --> 31:45.168
might run off with my money anytime.

871
31:46.008 --> 31:47.367
Once Lu Hui runs,

872
31:47.567 --> 31:49.008
Di Liren will vanish immediately.

873
31:49.208 --> 31:50.008
Now I suspect

874
31:50.087 --> 31:51.008
they might have

875
31:51.047 --> 31:51.968
a disagreement on this.

876
31:54.527 --> 31:55.208
How so?

877
32:02.127 --> 32:03.607
I'm in a good mood. No need to pay.

878
32:03.928 --> 32:04.527
It's on me.

879
32:07.168 --> 32:08.408
Before this,

880
32:08.408 --> 32:09.527
I understood why Di Liren

881
32:09.567 --> 32:10.248
wanted to gamble.

882
32:10.688 --> 32:11.928
If he could take over Jiali,

883
32:12.527 --> 32:14.127
he could siphon off more money.

884
32:14.807 --> 32:15.767
But I didn't expect

885
32:15.767 --> 32:17.292
your dad to give the signing authority to you,

886
32:17.728 --> 32:19.087
which put him on the back foot.

887
32:19.648 --> 32:20.888
His best move right now

888
32:20.888 --> 32:21.847
is to flee with money.

889
32:21.847 --> 32:22.488
Yet,

890
32:23.448 --> 32:24.047
he hasn't.

891
32:24.448 --> 32:25.527
Maybe Lu Hui is the one

892
32:25.567 --> 32:26.408
who wants to flee,

893
32:26.928 --> 32:27.807
not Di Liren.

894
32:28.367 --> 32:29.408
He's far more ambitious.

895
32:30.767 --> 32:32.208
Then what exactly is he after?

896
32:35.488 --> 32:36.488
Jiali's equity?

897
32:38.047 --> 32:39.367
Whatever he's after,

898
32:39.767 --> 32:40.567
we can only focus on

899
32:40.607 --> 32:41.448
what's at hand.

900
32:41.728 --> 32:43.208
Only by digging into Jinghua

901
32:43.367 --> 32:44.567
can we get leverage on him.

902
32:46.127 --> 32:47.127
On one hand,

903
32:47.488 --> 32:48.648
I need to find a way

904
32:48.928 --> 32:50.287
to get back to the company.

905
32:50.688 --> 32:51.807
On the other hand,

906
32:51.968 --> 32:53.047
I need to figure out

907
32:53.127 --> 32:54.567
how Han Guang and Di Liren

908
32:54.807 --> 32:55.728
managed to rig

909
32:55.767 --> 32:56.607
this test.

910
32:57.168 --> 32:57.847
I must take back

911
32:57.928 --> 32:58.968
the real test report.

912
32:59.807 --> 33:01.008
Who else is involved in

913
33:01.047 --> 33:02.047
the production process

914
33:02.367 --> 33:02.968
and might know

915
33:03.008 --> 33:04.127
the adulteration?

916
33:09.648 --> 33:10.527
The OEM factory head.

917
33:15.408 --> 33:16.087
Mr. Di,

918
33:16.488 --> 33:18.248
our factory suffered a lot of loss.

919
33:18.888 --> 33:20.527
You can't just brush this off.

920
33:23.767 --> 33:25.488
We'll have plenty of chances to cooperate.

921
33:26.367 --> 33:27.767
I'll offer more profit next time.

922
33:28.047 --> 33:28.648
How about that?

923
33:29.367 --> 33:30.208
Let's have a toast.

924
33:30.688 --> 33:31.728
To you and Mr. Han.

925
33:34.968 --> 33:35.607
Waiter.

926
33:35.968 --> 33:37.408
Open the other bottle too.

927
33:38.527 --> 33:39.847
I'm so sorry.

928
33:40.248 --> 33:41.567
Traffic was terrible today,

929
33:41.728 --> 33:42.327
so I'm late.

930
33:42.448 --> 33:43.168
Why are you here?

931
33:44.367 --> 33:45.087
Honey,

932
33:45.408 --> 33:46.688
you're treating to apologize,

933
33:46.847 --> 33:48.047
yet with no good wine.

934
33:48.527 --> 33:49.208
Once I heard it,

935
33:49.327 --> 33:50.248
I hurried home

936
33:50.367 --> 33:51.567
and grabbed two nice bottles.

937
33:54.367 --> 33:54.847
Mr. Han.

938
33:59.248 --> 34:00.248
And this is...

939
34:01.968 --> 34:02.888
This is Guangsili'er

940
34:02.928 --> 34:03.767
OEM factory head,

941
34:04.008 --> 34:04.567
Lin Qiang.

942
34:06.928 --> 34:07.448
Hello,

943
34:07.527 --> 34:08.087
Mr. Lin.

944
34:08.408 --> 34:09.808
So it's you who audited our books.

945
34:10.127 --> 34:11.288
Look at the mess you caused.

946
34:11.567 --> 34:13.247
Not only is my entire factory

947
34:13.488 --> 34:14.567
living in fear,

948
34:14.768 --> 34:15.567
our other partners

949
34:15.647 --> 34:16.888
are getting paranoid now.

950
34:17.247 --> 34:18.647
Some even canceled their orders!

951
34:18.968 --> 34:19.527
Do you know

952
34:19.527 --> 34:20.647
how much loss we suffer?

953
34:22.368 --> 34:23.008
Mr. Lin,

954
34:23.567 --> 34:24.448
don't get agitated.

955
34:26.768 --> 34:27.768
Tell me

956
34:28.408 --> 34:29.328
the desired solution.

957
34:30.127 --> 34:30.848
Compensate us!

958
34:31.888 --> 34:32.647
Compensate you?

959
34:34.167 --> 34:34.768
Sure.

960
34:36.207 --> 34:36.848
How much?

961
34:38.687 --> 34:39.647
However,

962
34:40.127 --> 34:41.328
I hope you

963
34:41.687 --> 34:42.647
think this through.

964
34:43.888 --> 34:45.047
Can you really afford

965
34:45.127 --> 34:46.207
Jiali's compensation?

966
34:46.607 --> 34:47.607
Demanding quality testing

967
34:47.647 --> 34:48.727
for our products

968
34:49.047 --> 34:50.488
is in accordance with the contract.

969
34:51.047 --> 34:52.008
If you insist,

970
34:52.448 --> 34:53.727
I can submit a request

971
34:53.808 --> 34:54.448
to the board.

972
34:55.087 --> 34:56.607
But whether the board agrees

973
34:56.687 --> 34:57.768
to pay,

974
34:57.848 --> 34:58.647
or suspends

975
34:58.727 --> 34:59.687
our partnership

976
34:59.928 --> 35:00.888
over this,

977
35:02.127 --> 35:03.207
that's out of my hands.

978
35:05.448 --> 35:06.087
Mr. Lin,

979
35:07.368 --> 35:08.247
no need for that.

980
35:08.328 --> 35:09.087
I brought you here

981
35:09.127 --> 35:10.687
just to introduce you to Mr. Di.

982
35:11.288 --> 35:12.047
The Jinghua matter

983
35:12.167 --> 35:12.928
is in the past.

984
35:13.207 --> 35:14.167
If you insist on

985
35:14.328 --> 35:15.448
compensation,

986
35:15.768 --> 35:16.727
it'll hurt our trust.

987
35:17.368 --> 35:19.288
Are you really going to go after Meng?

988
35:19.888 --> 35:20.567
Besides,

989
35:20.928 --> 35:22.607
Meng did nothing wrong.

990
35:22.848 --> 35:23.768
We're all trying

991
35:23.808 --> 35:25.127
to ensure the product's quality.

992
35:27.727 --> 35:28.928
Mr. Han is right.

993
35:30.328 --> 35:31.768
Meng meant well.

994
35:32.288 --> 35:33.808
If we had let it slide,

995
35:34.368 --> 35:35.408
and word leaked out,

996
35:35.768 --> 35:37.047
the damage to both our brands

997
35:37.167 --> 35:38.167
would've been much worse.

998
35:46.768 --> 35:47.368
Ms. Yu,

999
35:47.768 --> 35:48.768
I drank a bit too much,

1000
35:49.408 --> 35:50.567
and spoke out of turn.

1001
35:51.207 --> 35:52.008
I apologize.

1002
35:52.768 --> 35:53.288
I'm sorry.

1003
35:54.047 --> 35:54.888
I'll finish this pot.

1004
35:59.127 --> 36:00.288
Alright, Mr. Lin.

1005
36:00.488 --> 36:01.687
Meng is like my own sister.

1006
36:01.768 --> 36:02.647
She won't blame you.

1007
36:03.047 --> 36:03.527
Make sure

1008
36:03.607 --> 36:05.087
to watch your words.

1009
36:05.727 --> 36:06.647
Anyway,

1010
36:07.008 --> 36:08.207
the sender of that email

1011
36:08.368 --> 36:10.247
is the one who should be held liable.

1012
36:10.448 --> 36:11.047
Good point.

1013
36:12.247 --> 36:13.448
Where did he get

1014
36:13.527 --> 36:14.368
the samples,

1015
36:14.928 --> 36:16.607
and where were they tested?

1016
36:17.047 --> 36:18.247
Did he do all this

1017
36:18.328 --> 36:19.567
with ulterior motives

1018
36:20.008 --> 36:21.207
just to extort us?

1019
36:21.527 --> 36:22.207
We have no idea.

1020
36:22.527 --> 36:23.607
It's worth digging into.

1021
36:25.368 --> 36:26.368
I don't think so.

1022
36:27.408 --> 36:27.968
Right now,

1023
36:27.968 --> 36:29.087
we don't have any evidence.

1024
36:29.647 --> 36:31.328
Digging into it might cause a stir.

1025
36:31.488 --> 36:32.008
As

1026
36:32.047 --> 36:33.488
a content creator,

1027
36:33.768 --> 36:35.087
it will backfire online.

1028
36:36.167 --> 36:38.047
Meng, I know you're kind.

1029
36:38.247 --> 36:38.888
But whoever

1030
36:38.888 --> 36:40.328
smeared our product's quality

1031
36:40.527 --> 36:41.647
must have bad intentions.

1032
36:41.888 --> 36:43.008
I'm not being kind,

1033
36:43.127 --> 36:44.448
but considering the big picture.

1034
36:45.247 --> 36:46.008
If this person

1035
36:46.087 --> 36:47.167
truly intended to smear us,

1036
36:47.288 --> 36:47.768
why sent

1037
36:47.768 --> 36:48.888
an internal email?

1038
36:49.047 --> 36:49.647
He could've

1039
36:49.727 --> 36:50.647
publicized it.

1040
36:51.087 --> 36:52.127
Just because we don't know

1041
36:52.288 --> 36:53.607
what he wants,

1042
36:53.727 --> 36:55.047
we need to track him down.

1043
36:55.647 --> 36:56.207
Honey,

1044
36:56.768 --> 36:57.687
you're so objecting,

1045
36:57.888 --> 36:58.567
do you

